{"id":"sh/ydcnatkn","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 3","position":{"left":89.28,"top":160.32,"width":550,"height":26.88},"text":"最初の10人を見つける方法","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/l036l83y","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 4","position":{"left":89.28,"top":194.88,"width":1100.16,"height":161.28},"text":"猫を飼う知人・学校関係の紹介から5人、猫の飼育コミュニティから5人に聞く。\n脱走経験、見つからず困る頻度、今の対策、首輪と充電の許容範囲を確認する。\n\nまず10人は需要を検証する協力者。安全確認後、3家庭から試用を始める。\n販売開始時は、試用を続けたい人に購入を案内する。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/kzu5c32t","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 5","position":{"left":72,"top":401.28,"width":1134.72,"height":165.12},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#EEF4FF","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/725onyl4","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 6","position":{"left":89.28,"top":412.8,"width":316.8,"height":26.88},"text":"最初に試す集客方法","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/m1cnetkj","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":89.28,"top":447.36,"width":1100.16,"height":105.6},"text":"最初は知人の紹介で、30分の聞き取りを5件実施する。\n写真付きの説明資料で価格案を示し、連絡許可を得て試用希望者を記録する。\n実績ができたら地域の動物病院・ペット店に紹介の相談をする。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
